X:1
T:The Lord's My Shepherd (Brother James's Air)
T:MAROSA
C:Music: James Leith Macbeth Bain, 1915, alt · Words: Psalm 23 from the Scottish Psalter, 1650 alt. by James Leith Macbeth Bain, 1915
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The Great Peace" 1915.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/brother_james_air) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
M:3/2
L:1/4
Q:1/4=140
